From 4022d02a7a36ed297e92ab6e2e3cc962fe682705 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew Stone <matthew.d.stone@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:24:18 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Smarter Diagrams support

Smarter Diagrams compiles text to SVG, PNG and PDF with a single pure-Rust
binary. The service pipes the source into 'smarter-diagrams - --format <fmt>'
and returns stdout. Only built-in themes and validated view/step identifiers
are accepted (--theme-file and -o are not exposed), so local files are never
read or written regardless of KROKI_SAFE_MODE.

The binary is built in its own Docker stage with cargo install --locked
--features export from the pinned v0.1.0 release tag.
